    "created_at": "2016-11-01T23:11:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-01T23:11:15Z",
    "body": "> Or, we could just remove it entirely, and leave this spatial navigation mode as some sort of outside-the-spec enhancement?\n\nthat would get my vote. i understand the desire that UAs _should_ simplify developers' life by triggering `click` without the need for explicit keyboard handling, but saying that UAs _should_ therefore provide some mechanism/mode is perhaps going outside of the purpose of the spec.\n\nBut I would like to see the current reality reflected in the spec. At a stretch, perhaps add a \"User agents _may_ provide a mode...\" extra clause, just to open up the possibility of it happening (and to reflect spatnav scenarios)?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
