    "created_at": "2016-11-01T23:16:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-01T23:16:30Z",
    "body": "> Fascinating. I cannot find anything on how to enable spatial navigation in Chrome, but some Googling shows it might be enable-able in Opera?\n\nPresto-based Opera (i.e. up until v12) had spatial navigation as a user setting (`opera:config#UserPrefs|EnableSpatialNavigation`). We [added support to Chromium](https://src.chromium.org/viewvc/chrome?revision=194875&view=revision) but AFAIK Chromium-based Opera (i.e. v15 and up) doesn’t have a user setting to enable it.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
